WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.800
A real CO₂ record. Only its low-pressure tenth is shown; six models fit it within tolerance.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:11.100
Beyond the window the fits fan out. The blue band is every isotherm the visible points allow.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:17.400
Reveal the measurements: all 31 lie in the certified band; the best fit holds for 1.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.700
Without the site structure, a shape-only band is also safe but much wider.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.500
Another record, hidden again.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Here 14 of 136 points escape the band: the guarantee is relative to the class, and the page says so.
